        <p>Latchford Brittania Res 4 W'gton United Res ... 3 Penketh 2 Peas ley Cross 0 Oughtrington Reserve ... 1 Stockton Heath 1 Latchford Reserve 3 Highfleld 2 FIXTURES FOR TO-DAY. FIRST DIVISION.</p>
