      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-10-03_WidnesExaminer_art0094" n="art0094">
        <head>AN EXPLA,NA.Td.RY CATECHISM.</head>
        <p>AN EXPLA,NA.Td.RY CATECHISM.</p>
        <p>1. What is Gwilytn. Evans' Quininc,Bitters 7</p>
        <p>An excellent vegetable Remedy, prepared in the most skilful and scientific manner, and contaiAino• the active principles of those plants generally acknowledged to be the best remedial agents, and to possess the most heal- ing and curative properties. It is now extensively used ih inlay countries, and everywhere acknowledged as the Best Tonic Remedy known.</p>
        <p>2. What does it contain</p>
