        <p>3. What is its action 1</p>
        <p>It assists and promotes Digestion, strengthens the Nerves and Muscles, purifies the Blood, enlivens the Spirits, and removes all Obstructions and Impurities in the Human Body. It gives tone to the whole system. It strengthens and fortifies those mrts which have been weakened by Disease, and are consbquently more liable to Colds and unhealthful influences. It has gained the Highest Recommendations as the Best Family Medicine and a remedy for every kind of Weakness.</p>
